			"notes": "```yaml\nChanges:\n  - Added /placecooldown [player] [command] <seconds> with the permission `cooldowncommands.placecooldown`.\n    - Not including the <seconds> argument will apply the default cooldown suited for that player.\n    - This only works on commands defined in the config.\n  - Added /removecooldown [player] [command] with the permission `cooldowncommands.removecooldown`.\n  - Added more to config.yml:\n    - Added lang for the commands: `prefix`, `invalid-command`, `bypasses-cooldown`, `placed-cooldown`, and `removed-cooldown`.\n    - Added an \"applies-on-use\" option to all cooldown commands. This allows you to only place cooldowns on commands via the above command.\n    - You may want to refresh the config again. My b.\n```"
		},
